# PTF Slash Commands Directory
#
# This directory will contain PTF slash commands:
# - init.md      - Initialize project, run goal analysis (/ptf:init)
# - decompose.md - Run full 5-step decomposition (/ptf:decompose)
# - plan.md      - Generate human-readable plan (/ptf:plan)
# - execute.md   - Execute single wave or all waves (/ptf:execute)
# - status.md    - Show execution state (/ptf:status)
# - verify.md    - Run verification on task (/ptf:verify)
# - resume.md    - Resume from interruption (/ptf:resume)
# - retry.md     - Retry failed task (/ptf:retry)
# - abort.md     - Stop execution, preserve state (/ptf:abort)
#
# Commands invoke PTF subagents defined in .claude/agents/
